Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.22,0:01:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过份了， 怎么这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还买了礼物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管何时你都来啊
