Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:56.25,0:26:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:07.19,0:26:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你陪我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:20.27,0:26:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了\N圣诞快乐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:33.15,0:27:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想被我玩的是谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:40.22,0:27:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:43.16,0:27:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:46.23,0:27:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想怎样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:50.23,0:27:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想被你打
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:53.17,0:27:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打哪\N屁股
