Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:58.16,0:29:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:02.17,0:29:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:06.17,0:29:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:08.17,0:29:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好怪
