Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:38.14,0:48:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好开心又好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:42.15,0:48:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:56.16,0:49:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞节一个人要干嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:01.23,0:49:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在干嘛?\N好寂莫
