Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:18.18,0:49:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞节还看这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:21.25,0:49:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂...别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:27.26,0:49:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LP也硬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:34.20,0:49:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:37.27,0:49:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞老人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:44.21,0:49:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字是光永蠢笨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:47.28,0:49:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,28岁\N经验人数三人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:50.22,0:49:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没女友已有五年
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:52.22,0:49:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天DIY五次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:54.22,0:49:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:57.29,0:50:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年前去打小钢珠输了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:01.29,0:50:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两年前在蛋糕店打工
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:04.23,0:50:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年前钱包掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:06.23,0:50:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N不要说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:09.30,0:50:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五年前..也太寂寞了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:14.24,0:50:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好惨的日子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:20.25,0:50:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道你以后不交的到女友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:26.25,0:50:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我带了很棒的礼物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:31.19,0:50:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:34.26,0:50:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以用它想怎么拍我就拍我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:45.20,0:50:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何很好用吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:49.21,0:50:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可思议
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:53.21,0:51:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要怎么办\N来拍我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:07.23,0:51:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说拍什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:15.23,0:51:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都行?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:25.24,0:51:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:29.25,0:51:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以从近拍吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:58.21,0:52:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好安静
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:08.22,0:52:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞老人伤脑筋吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:28.24,0:52:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很突然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:31.18,0:52:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以来踩我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:38.25,0:52:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以踩吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:50.26,0:52:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:13.22,0:53:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬了
