Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:35.24,0:53:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞老人应该不要露这么多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:44.18,0:53:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为想改变形象
