Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:50.23,1:07:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快出来了\N在我上面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:42.15,1:08:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:13.24,1:09:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
